{"complete":true,"city":"Moscow","template_id":"global-zero-dollars","title":"Zero Dollars: 10 Things Locals Do for Free","description":"Ten Moscow resets that need no ticket: sculpture walks, palace-park loops, workout stops, riverside miles, and one free shuttle.","icon":"money_off","cards":[{"entity_name":"VDNH","title":"Ride the free VDNH shuttle","subtitle":"A no-fare circuit through the exhibition grounds","notes":"Board the electric bus beside the Main Entrance arch. VDNH states that the grounds have free admission and the shuttle is free; museums and other ticketed attractions remain separate.","short_summary":"Circle VDNH without paying a fare, hopping off near fountains, pavilions, Ostankino Park, or the Botanical Garden.","source_url":"https://vdnh.ru/transport/proezd-po-territorii/","source_title":"Проезд по территории — ВДНХ","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Tsaritsyno Museum-Reserve","title":"Walk Tsaritsyno Park for free","subtitle":"Palace façades, ponds, and long landscaped paths","notes":"The museum’s official FAQ explicitly says admission to Tsaritsyno Park is free. Indoor exhibitions and palace rooms require separate tickets.","short_summary":"Use the free park as the main event: trace the ponds and bridges, then view the palace ensemble from outside.","source_url":"https://tsaritsyno-museum.ru/fakty/f-a-q/","source_title":"Часто задаваемые вопросы — Музей-заповедник «Царицыно»","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Muzeon Park of Arts","title":"Browse Muzeon’s sculptures for free","subtitle":"An open-air art walk beside Krymsky Val","notes":"Moscow’s official park portal lists free admission and explains that the entry charge was removed so visitors could see the contemporary-art objects. Ticketed events may still cost extra.","short_summary":"Thread through the outdoor sculpture collection, then continue toward the river without crossing a ticket barrier.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/museon/mesta","source_title":"Места — Парк искусств «Музеон» — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Izmailovsky Park","title":"Use Izmailovsky’s courts for free","subtitle":"Bring a ball or paddles to the east-side park","notes":"The official city park page lists free admission alongside volleyball and basketball courts and six summer table-tennis tables. Bring your own equipment to avoid relying on paid rental services.","short_summary":"Turn a free park visit into a pickup-game afternoon on the listed courts and seasonal tennis tables.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/izmailovo/mesta","source_title":"Места — Парк культуры и отдыха «Измайловский» — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Bauman Garden","title":"Play table tennis in Bauman Garden for free","subtitle":"A compact garden session near the old center","notes":"Moscow’s park portal confirms free garden admission and several table-tennis tables. Bring paddles and a ball; rentals and other commercial services are not included in the free claim.","short_summary":"Drop into the garden with your own kit for a few games among the paths and historic buildings.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/baumana/mesta","source_title":"Места — Сад им. Баумана — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Hermitage Garden","title":"Lounge in Hermitage Garden for free","subtitle":"Deck chairs, table-tennis tables, and Wi-Fi off Karetny Ryad","notes":"The official city park page explicitly lists free admission, loungers, table-tennis tables, and park-wide Wi-Fi. Equipment rental and theater performances may carry separate charges.","short_summary":"Claim a lounger or bring your own table-tennis gear for a low-key pause in this central garden.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/ermitazh/mesta","source_title":"Места — Сад «Эрмитаж» — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Sokolniki Park","title":"Train on Sokolniki’s workout grounds for free","subtitle":"Open exercise platforms inside a round-the-clock park","notes":"Moscow’s official park directory states that entry is free and identifies outdoor workout platforms. Pools, rentals, attractions, and organized sports facilities may charge separately.","short_summary":"Build a body-weight circuit around the park’s workout platforms, with no admission ticket required.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/sokolniki/mesta","source_title":"Места — Парк культуры и отдыха «Сокольники» — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Gorky Park","title":"Roll through Gorky Park for free","subtitle":"Long paths between Krymsky Val and Neskuchny Garden","notes":"The city park portal explicitly lists round-the-clock free admission and says the park is suited to roller skating. Bring your own skates because rental points are commercial services.","short_summary":"Use the broad park paths for a no-ticket skate, extending south when you want a longer run.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/gorkogo/eda","source_title":"Еда — Центральный парк культуры и отдыха имени М. Горького — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Kolomenskoye Estate","title":"Roam Kolomenskoye’s grounds for free","subtitle":"An all-day estate walk above the Moskva River","notes":"Moscow’s official park directory lists Kolomenskoye as open around the clock with free admission. Museum interiors and guided programs are outside that claim.","short_summary":"Make a free circuit through the estate landscape and inspect its historic architecture from the public grounds.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/list","source_title":"Список парков Москвы — Мосгорпарк","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Park 850-Letiya Moskvy","title":"Follow the riverside park for free","subtitle":"A long public greenway in Maryino","notes":"Moscow’s official park directory lists Park 850-Letiya Moskvy as open around the clock with free admission. Paid rentals or concessions are optional and not part of the activity.","short_summary":"Take an unhurried walk through this southeastern park without an entrance fee or required purchase.","source_url":"https://mosgor-park.ru/parks/list","source_title":"Список парков Москвы — Мосгорпарк","latitude":55.6419139,"longitude":37.7443974,"place_id":"ChIJZ9GWZA0vtUYRxjqkufYT8yI","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJZ9GWZA0vtUYRxjqkufYT8yI"}],"warnings":[]}
